sequenceDiagram
    actor Student as Student
    participant Portal as Diploma Portal
    participant Api as Review API
    participant Queue as Build Queue
    participant Worker as PDF Worker
    database Db as Metadata DB
    participant Storage as Artifact Storage
    participant Mail as Notification Service

    Student->>Portal: Upload note sources
    Portal->>Api: POST /builds with project path
    Api->>Db: Create build request
    Api->>Queue: Enqueue PDF build
    Queue-->>Api: build_id
    Api-->>Portal: 202 Accepted
    loop Wait for build
        Portal->>Api: GET /builds/{build_id}
        Api->>Db: Read build status
        Db-->>Api: status snapshot
        Api-->>Portal: status and diagnostics
    end
    Worker->>Queue: Claim build task
    Worker->>Storage: Read source bundle
    alt Build succeeds
        Worker->>Storage: Save PDF artifact
        Worker->>Db: Mark build completed
        Worker->>Mail: Send result link
    else Build fails
        Worker->>Storage: Save error bundle
        Worker->>Db: Mark build failed
        Worker->>Mail: Send readable error summary
    end
    Portal-->>Student: Show final build state
